#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/si-builder.ipynb:10002
msgid "构建源信息"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/si-builder.ipynb:10004
msgid "`tvm/include/tvm/ir/si_builder.h` 定义了名为 `SIBuilder` 的类，用于在重写表达式期间构建源信息。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/si-builder.ipynb:20002
msgid "该类提供了以下公共成员函数："
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/si-builder.ipynb:20004
msgid "`SIBuilder(const Span& span = Span())`：创建空的 `SIBuilder` 对象。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/si-builder.ipynb:20005
msgid ""
"`SIBuilder(const Array<Span>& spans = Array<Span>())`：从一个 `Span` 数组中创建一个 "
"`SIBuilder` 对象。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/si-builder.ipynb:20006
msgid ""
"`SIBuilder(const std::initializer_list<Span>& init)`：从一个 `Span` "
"初始化器列表中创建一个 `SIBuilder` 对象。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/si-builder.ipynb:20007
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`SIBuilder(const T& entry, const tvm::Array<T>& inputs = {})`：从一个给定的 "
"`entry` 和一个输入 `inputs` 创建一个 `SIBuilder` 对象。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/si-builder.ipynb:20008
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`SIBuilder(const tir::Stmt& entry, const tvm::Array<PrimExpr>& inputs = "
"{})`：从一个给定的 `entry` 和一个输入 `inputs` 创建一个 `SIBuilder` 对象。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/si-builder.ipynb:20009
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`SIBuilder(const tir::Stmt& entry, const tvm::Array<tir::Stmt>& inputs = "
"{})`：从一个给定的 `entry` 和一个输入 `inputs` 创建一个 `SIBuilder` 对象。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/si-builder.ipynb:20010
msgid "`~SIBuilder()`：析构函数。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/si-builder.ipynb:20011
msgid "`SIBuilder(const SIBuilder&) = delete`：禁止拷贝构造。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/si-builder.ipynb:20012
msgid "`SIBuilder& operator=(const SIBuilder&) = delete`：禁止赋值拷贝。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/si-builder.ipynb:20013
msgid "`Span Build() const`：构建一个基于给定的 `Span` 或子图的源信息跨度。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/si-builder.ipynb:20014
msgid ""
"`void RecursivelyFillSpan(const T& entry, const std::unordered_set<T, "
"ObjectPtrHash, ObjectPtrEqual>& inputs) const`：递归地填充从 `entry` 到 `inputs` "
"的所有 `Expr` 的跨度。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/si-builder.ipynb:20015
msgid ""
"`void RecursivelyFillSpan(const tir::Stmt& entry, const "
"std::unordered_set<PrimExpr, ObjectPtrHash, ObjectPtrEqual>& inputs) "
"const`：递归地填充从 `entry` 到 `inputs` 的所有 `PrimExpr` 的跨度。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/si-builder.ipynb:20016
msgid ""
"`void RecursivelyFillSpan(const tir::Stmt& entry, const "
"std::unordered_set<tir::Stmt, ObjectPtrHash, ObjectPtrEqual>& inputs) "
"const`：递归地填充从 `entry` 到 `inputs` 的所有 `Stmt` 的跨度。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/si-builder.ipynb:20018
msgid "私有成员变量包括："
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/si-builder.ipynb:20020
msgid "`struct Impl;`：内部实现结构体。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/si-builder.ipynb:20021
msgid "`std::unique_ptr<Impl> impl_`：指向内部实现结构体的指针。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/source-map/si-builder.ipynb:20022
msgid ""
"`std::unique_ptr<Impl> CreateImpl(const Span& span)`：根据给定的 `span` "
"创建内部实现结构体。"
msgstr ""

